● Found a real statistical bug, not just a plotting one: log2-fold change and
  HDI 3%/97% are on different scales in scCODA's output (HDI bounds the Final 
  Parameter CLR-space coefficient, not the derived log2-fold-change) — plotting
  them together as error bars is meaningless. Fixing the table schema and plot
  to use the matching pair.

