● Root cause confirmed: obs[[cond_col]] comes back as an R factor (not
  character) from the h5ad/zellkonverter round-trip, and relevel(ref = <factor 
  value>) breaks because relevel.factor only does its safe character→index
  lookup when ref is literally a character. This is a real, deeper bug affecting
  run_deseq2()'s fallback path too (silently — no crash logged, but clearly not
  doing what's intended). Let me fix all three occurrences.

  Searched for 1 pattern, read 1 file, ran 1 shell command (ctrl+o to expand)

